{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 156697, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 104934, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "DC韩语速成手册", "tag": "", "created_at": 1653063799, "updated_at": 1653121957, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1661657474, "last_at": 1661657474, "comment_count": 9, "status": 1, "summary": "本手册的目的是让候补生们在没有汉化的情况下也能看懂游戏中的部分文本（反正我是信了）。朝鲜语/韩国语简介朝鲜语是朝鲜民族所使用的语言，在朝鲜半岛南部又称为韩国语。韩语使用的文字叫做谚文，是朝鲜王朝的世宗", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7375, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 2, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 156697, "content": "<div><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span><span><div><span><span><span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><span><span><span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\">本手册的目的是让候补生们在没有汉化的情况下也能看懂游戏中的部分文本（反正我是信了）。</div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><div></div></div></span></span><div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(75,82,91);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">朝鲜语/韩国语简介</span></span></p></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div>朝鲜语是朝鲜民族所使用的语言，在朝鲜半岛南部又称为韩国语。</div><div>韩语使用的文字叫做谚文，是朝鲜王朝的世宗大王在五百多年前创造的。</div><div>韩语中包含了大量的汉字词和英语词，这是本速成手册成立的条件。</div><div><br></div><div>韩语是一种<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">表音文字</span>，有21个母音（元音），19个子音（辅音）和27个收音。<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">每个字都由子音，母音和收音（可选）组成。子音在左、上或左上部，收音在最底部。</span></div><div><br></div><div>韩语的语序一般是<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">主宾谓</span>。</div><div><br></div><div>学习时<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">尽量不要把韩语的读音与汉语拼音的读音绑定起来</span>，因为它们并不能完全的对应。我的专业研究的不是人类语言，我凑合着写，大家将就着看。水平不足，难免有错漏，请大家包涵（反正也不会有多少阅读量）。</div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">目录</p></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div>手册拟分为八个章节，分别是：</div><div>1、母音（元音）</div><div>2、子音（辅音）</div><div>3、收音</div><div>4、音变</div><div>5、游戏界面</div><div>6、魂卡<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">&amp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">附魔</span></div><div>7、技能&amp;Buff</div><div>8、介词</div><div><br></div><div>本手册不会包含很多语法方面的内容，在认识词语后看句子可以靠蒙。</div></span><div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 81618, "username": "lyzzzk", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "个性签名", "follow_num": 33, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "锟斤拷烫烫烫", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_